Evan,

check the format of  your input data. Your SORAy data frame should have a dimension of 91x36 (91 by 12*3) not 563x3. Your siteCovs should  have a dimension of 91xn, one row for each site. Same problem for your years data frame. Look at the help for unmarkedMultFrame and make sure your data is correctly formatted.

Best,

Mathias

